DESIGN SYSTEM — Marketing Landing Page. Implement these EXACT values; do not substitute your own colors, fonts, or sizes:
Color tokens (EXACT). Put \`color-scheme: light dark\` on :root and define each token once — every value is a light-dark() pair, so the app ships BOTH themes from one definition:
  --bg: light-dark(oklch(0.99 0.004 40), oklch(0.15 0.012 30));
